OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,FSam Blackledge reports on growing
OL,7,Fconcern among farmers as Bluetongue
OL,8,Fcases continue to rocket
OL,10,FThe Bluetongue virus is continuing to
OL,11,Fspread rapidly across the South West,
OL,12,Fwith more than 200 cases since the
OL,13,Fstart of July, more than double where
OL,14,Fthat figure was at the start of this
OL,15,Fweek.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,FExperts say the disease is likely to
OL,7,Fhave worsened due to climate change,
OL,8,Fand 'desperate' farmers are calling on
OL,9,Fthe Government to urgently step in
OL,10,Fwith financial support for those
OL,11,Faffected.
OL,13,FRachel Gilmour, Liberal Democrat MP
OL,14,Ffor Tiverton and Minehead, has
OL,15,Fexpressed concern about the impact the
OL,16,Fcrisis may have on farmers' mental
OL,17,Fhealth.
OL,19,F'No support'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,FJames Warwick, a farmer in Cornwall,
OL,7,Fsays he has lost at least 20 ewes so
OL,8,Ffar as a result of the virus.
OL,10,F"We are struggling as an industry,"
OL,11,FJames said.
OL,13,F"There's no support from any of the
OL,14,FGovernment parties. I don't care
OL,15,Fwhether it's Labour or the
OL,16,FConservatives, we are right at the
OL,17,Fbottom of the pack.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,F"I can't see me being able to afford
OL,7,Fto replace these ewes because there's
OL,8,Fno spare cash to go and buy any more
OL,9,Fsheep.
OL,11,F"So I don't really know what we're
OL,12,Fgoing to do."
OL,14,FCraig Martin, from Lilly's Farm near
OL,15,FCamelford, said: "I'm probably #5,000
OL,16,Fdown from last week. We didn't
OL,17,Fvaccinate because we've never had it
OL,18,Fin Cornwall. So we didn't think we
OL,19,Fwere going to get it, and it's hit us
OL,20,Freally hard."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,FOfficial figures show 214 reported
OL,7,Fcases since the start of July, a
OL,8,Fnumber which has more than doubled
OL,9,Fsince the start of this week.
OL,11,FBut many farmers feel the true picture
OL,12,Fcould be much worse.
OL,14,FDominic Elson, who owns a farm in
OL,15,FCombe Martin in North Devon, said:
OL,16,F"The problem is that it's hitting rams
OL,17,Fworse than ewes, and therefore rams
OL,18,Fare losing fertility.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,F"That's going to create a problem, and
OL,7,Fthere's going to be a fertility issue
OL,8,Fin cattle too.
OL,10,F"So this actually has a national
OL,11,Feconomic hit for farming, but here in
OL,12,FNorth Devon, where farming is such an
OL,13,Fimportant part of the economy, this
OL,14,Fcould have quite a lot of consequences
OL,15,Fif we find the whole scale of this is
OL,16,Fbeginning to affect productivity right
OL,17,Facross the region."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,F'Helplessness'JExperts believe that
OL,7,Fthe recent warm weather has allowed
OL,8,Fthe virus to develop inside midges,
OL,9,Fwhich have been blown in from Europe.
OL,11,FTim Parish, Exmoor National Park
OL,12,Franger, said: "It's not just a few
OL,13,Fcases, suddenly it's absolutely
OL,14,Frocketed across Exmoor.
OL,16,F"It is devastating for people seeing
OL,17,Ftheir flock going down. The
OL,18,Fhelplessness of going around your
OL,19,Fstock in the morning and finding more
OL,20,Fand more going down.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,F"It's not just the wildfires we worry
OL,7,Fabout as climate change kicks in, it's
OL,8,Fthings like the Bluetongue disease
OL,9,Fcoming over and becoming more
OL,10,Fprevalent as conditions change."
OL,12,FThe outbreak is already having an
OL,13,Fimpact beyond farms. Some agricultural
OL,14,Fshows in Devon have cancelled their
OL,15,Fsheep, cattle and goat classes this
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,F'Two-week lag'JThe whole of England is
OL,7,Fnow in a 'bluetongue restricted zone',
OL,8,Fmeaning there are tighter rules around
OL,9,Fmovement of animals and germinal
OL,10,Fproducts.
OL,12,FNFU vice president Robyn Munt said:
OL,13,F"There is a two-week lag between the
OL,14,Finformation that we've currently got
OL,15,Fonline and what's happening on the
OL,16,Fground, because that's how long it
OL,17,Ftakes between notifying and getting
OL,18,Fthe results of a test.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,F"We are expecting a significant rise
OL,7,Fin numbers over the next week to two
OL,8,Fweeks."
OL,10,FRachel Gilmour, Liberal Democrat MP
OL,11,Ffor Tiverton and Minehead, said: "We
OL,12,Fknow that suicide rates for farmers
OL,13,Fare higher than the national average
OL,15,F"I would just like to remind my
OL,16,Ffarmers that I will always be there
OL,17,Ffor them, even if they need to pick up
OL,18,Fthe phone and talk to me personally,
OL,19,For visit the health hub, or go and see
OL,20,Ftheir doctor.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,F"The important thing is that they
OL,7,Fdon't keep their anxieties to
OL,8,Fthemselves, that they talk to each
OL,9,Fother and they talk to their families
OL,10,Fand their communities.
OL,12,F"Andy Burnham says he wants to look
OL,13,Fafter parts of the country like
OL,14,FTiverton and Minehead. And I'm going
OL,15,Fto hold him to account. I'm going to
OL,16,Fbe at the front of that queue, come
OL,17,Fhell or high water, to make sure that
OL,18,Fhe listens to what my farmers and my
OL,19,Fcommunity have to say. "
OL,21,F'Difficult time'
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,FA Defra spokesman said: "We recognise
OL,7,Fthis is an incredibly difficult time
OL,8,Ffor animal keepers who are on the
OL,9,Ffrontline of this disease, and we are
OL,10,Fmonitoring the situation closely.
OL,12,F"Farmers should continue to be
OL,13,Fvigilant and monitor their animals
OL,14,Ffrequently, reporting any suspicions
OL,15,Fof disease to APHA.
OL,17,F"We continue to work closely with
OL,18,Findustry and are putting processes in
OL,19,Fplace to bring in additional vaccine
OL,20,Fsupplies to help farmers to protect
OL,21,Ftheir livestock."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40813
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,FA spokesman for the Animal and Plant
OL,7,FHealth Agency said: "Bluetongue virus
OL,8,Fis circulating in England,
OL,9,Fparticularly Southwest England and
OL,10,Fparts of Wales.
OL,12,F"The recent period of hot and humid
OL,13,Fweather has been favourable for midge
OL,14,Fpopulations which has likely
OL,15,Fcontributed to increased numbers of
OL,16,Fcases, in cattle and particularly
OL,17,Fsheep.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,409,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40814
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1786376897
OL,3,CBluetongue virus 'rocketing' as cases
OL,4,Cmore than double in one week
OL,6,F"Livestock keepers should remain
OL,7,Fvigilant and report any suspicions of
OL,8,Fdisease to APHA. We encourage all
OL,9,Ffarmers and keepers to discuss
OL,10,Fvaccination with their vet as this is
OL,11,Fthe most effective way of protecting
OL,12,Ftheir animals."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G14/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
